        <p>Deadstock (Brand New) shoes command an average margin of ${ds_margin:,.2f}, versus ${vnds_margin:,.2f} for VNDS and ${used_margin:,.2f} for Used. The DS-to-Used premium gap is ${ds_used_gap:,.2f} per pair — condition preservation is the single largest margin lever available. Every effort to maintain deadstock status (original box, tags, no try-ons) directly protects resale value.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Target High-Margin Colorways for Sourcing</strong>
