      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Leverage Seasonal Demand Patterns</strong>
        <p>Monthly data reveals seasonal variation in both margins and transaction velocity. Listing during high-demand windows can compress days-in-inventory while maintaining or improving margin. Monitor quarterly trends for momentum shifts that signal market cooling or heating.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
